Sdiode1 SYNC_COMP SYNC_DOMINENT SYNC_COMP SYNC_DOMINENT SWCLAMP
Rq8 SET1 ONEND1 500  
Rcs2f CS2 CS2INT { IF(IC==0,1,2E3) }  
