Cof OUTOFF 0 3E-12 IC=0 
Rsu4 SC4 SC5 500  
Rq4 SET ONEND 500  
Ggateloss VIN 0 VALUE { I(VVCC) }
Rcs2dis1 CS2 CSDIS1  40  
