Evcc2 VCC2 0 VALUE { if(V(uv1)>1, V(vcc1), 0.77) }
Evcc1 VCC1 0 TABLE { V(VIN) } ( (0, 0.77) (4.5, 0.77) (10.8, 8.57) )
Evdd VDD1 0 TABLE { V(VCC) } ( (5.3,0.0) (7.5,5) )
Ert RT1 0 TABLE { V(vdd) } ( (0,0) (2,2) )
Rssdis SS SSdis 200
